l":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/deployments","created_at":"2013-07-06T21:57:21Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T00:56:38Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T12:13:25Z","git_url":"git://github.com/etcd-io/etcd.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:etcd-io/etcd.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd","homepage":"https://etcd.io","size":93446,"stargazers_count":50971,"watchers_count":50971,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":false,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":10239,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":204,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cncf","consensus","database","distributed-database","distributed-systems","etcd","go","key-value","kubernetes","raft"],"visibility":"public","forks":10239,"open_issues":204,"watchers":50971,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"cluster initialization fails on the following commandline:\n\n```\n./etcd \\\n  --name $(hostname) \\\n  --listen-peer-urls \"https://0.0.0.0:2380,https://0.0.0.0:7001\" \\\n  --listen-client-urls \"https://0.0.0.0:2379,https://0.0.0.0:4001\" \\\n  --advertise-client-urls \"https://$(hostname -f):2379\" \\\n  --initial-advertise-peer-urls \"https://$(hostname -f):2380\" \\\n  --peer-ca-file=/etc/etcd/ca.crt --peer-cert-file=/etc/etcd/node.crt --peer-key-file=/etc/etcd/node.key \\\n  --ca-file=/etc/etcd/ca.crt --cert-file=/etc/etcd/node.crt --key-file=/etc/etcd/node.key \\\n  --initial-cluster-state new \\\n  --initial-cluster-token 'mycluster' \\\n  --initial-cluster 'etcd-001=https://etcd-001:2380,etcd-002=https://etcd-002:2380,etcd-003=https://etcd-003:2380'\n```\n\n```\n$ ./start.sh\n2015/01/22 13:14:52 netutil: Resolving etcd-001:2380 to 10.0.0.136:2380\n2015/01/22 13:14:52 netutil: Resolving etcd-001:2379 to 10.0.0.136:2379\n2015/01/22 13:14:52 netutil: Resolving etcd-001:2379 to 10.0.0.136:2379\n2015/01/22 13:14:52 no data-dir provided, using default data-dir ./etcd-001.etcd\n2015/01/22 13:14:52 etcd: peerTLS: cert = /etc/etcd/node.crt, key = /etc/etcd/node.key, ca = /etc/etcd/ca.crt\n2015/01/22 13:14:53 etcd: listening for peers on https://0.0.0.0:2380\n2015/01/22 13:14:54 etcd: listening for peers on https://0.0.0.0:7001\n2015/01/22 13:14:54 etcd: clientTLS: cert = /etc/etcd/node.crt, key = /etc/etcd/node.key, ca = /etc/etcd/ca.crt\n2015/01/22 13:14:54 etcd: listening for client requests on https://10.0.0.136:2379\n\n2015/01/22 13:14:54 etcd: stopping listening for client requests on https://10.0.0.136:2379\n2015/01/22 13:14:54 etcd: stopping listening for peers on https://0.0.0.0:7001\n2015/01/22 13:14:54 etcd: stopping listening for peers on https://0.0.0.0:2380\n2015/01/22 13:14:54 etcd: etcd-001 has different advertised URLs in the cluster and advertised peer URLs list\n```\n\napurls is `[https://10.0.0.136:2380]` and `m.PeerURLs` is `[https://etcd-001:2380/]` at this point:\n\n``` go\n    if !reflect.DeepEqual(apurls, m.PeerURLs) {\n        return fmt.Errorf(\"%s has different advertised URLs in the cluster and advertised peer URLs list\", c.Name)\n    }\n```\n\nI'm specifying initial-cluster url in hostname, because IP address is not fixed in our environment and etcd requires valid common name / subjectAltName validation for cluster peer URL.\n\nCommit 705ec450830035a5d3cb4a5e9fd157ec098410a8  (#1991, #1996) is a cause of this issue... resolves `apurls`. So reverting the commit fixes the problem... but it makes issue #1991 again.\n\nI'm planning to write a patch to make to try hostname verification with member name. Suggest me if there's better way.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/2123/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/2123/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]